WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE LANGUAGES: ja-JP (Japanese), en-US (English translation)

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:25.800
夕暮れの港に優しい風が吹く [The gentle wind blows on the evening port]

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:34.200
重い影は岸に残していく [Leave your heavy shadows behind on the shore]

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.200
穏やかな波が明日へ運ぶよ [The gentle waves will carry you to tomorrow]

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:50.500
星空の下で瞳を休めて [Rest your eyes under the starry sky]

00:00:50.500 --> 00:01:02.000
海の上ならもう安全だから [For upon the sea, you are safe now]

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:13.500
船は静かな子守唄を歌う [The ship sings a quiet lullaby]

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:21.800
急がなくていい、時を預けて [There is no need to rush, just entrust the time]

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:29.800
穏やかな波が明日へ運ぶよ [The gentle waves will carry you to tomorrow]

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:38.200
星空の下で瞳を休めて [Rest your eyes under the starry sky]

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:49.500
海の上ならもう安全だから [For upon the sea, you are safe now]

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:57.800
ああ、星空よ、夜を越えてゆけ [Ah, starry sky, travel across the night]

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:12.000
おやすみ、旅人、また明日 [Goodnight, traveler, see you tomorrow]

